# P6 of the OpenGL 4.6 plan: the four stages of a tessellated draw, to show they compile and link (OpenGL 4.6 Plan tab)
Shader tess_test

Buffer DrawData binding=1

Vertex "tess_test.vert"
TessControl "tess_test.tesc"
TessEval "tess_test.tese"
Fragment "tess_test.frag"
